    {
      "id": "text-7",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "The moment the sun disappears along the horizon, this urban, \"8-D\" city comes to life. Despite it being ruthlessly hot, my cyberpunk dream of experiencing the vertical landscape of this city became a reality. From neon views to spicy eats to being dropped off at the wrong elevation, I could only wish I had more evenings to just walk by the river and watch."
    },
